  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2174.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este viernes ha continuado en Onda la III Ruta de la Tapa, que se ha iniciado por ejemplo en Campus o Serral&iacute;n (en la piscina de verano), tambi&eacute;n la I Ruta de Gin Tonic, organizada igualmente por Hosturionda, y la Orkesta Pelillo ha desplegado en el pub El Sitio sus versiones de rock, punk y ska.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2169.jpg\" alt=\"img_2169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2170.jpg\" alt=\"img_2170\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2171.jpg\" alt=\"img_2171\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2172.jpg\" alt=\"img_2172\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2173.jpg\" alt=\"img_2173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2174.jpg\" alt=\"img_2174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2176.jpg\" alt=\"img_2176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tapesorkestapelillodivendres151113onda/img_2177.jpg\" alt=\"img_2177\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976